SGMethod=1
Cmn1=Auto Shutdown\\\\This module allows for a user configurable auto||1
Cmn2=shutdown routine.  The user is prompted with a warning and a countdown||1
Cmn3=timer before the system is automatically shutdown.\\The prompt will||1
Cmn4=appear at the paramter specified time BEFORE the user configured||1
Cmn5=shutdown time.  \\\\Parameters\\*Countdown Time Decimal - Decimal||1
Cmn6=value for the lenght of the countdown timer.\\*Countdown Time Seconds||1
Cmn7=- Time value for lenght of countdown.  The prompt will appear this||1
Cmn8=many seconds before the user set shutdown time.\\*File Name - *.
Cmn9=txt file to store hours, minutes, and enable value.\\\\\\
]
